<h3><u>Bichaao farshe aza mai zarur aaungi</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p dir=""ltr"">Bichaao farshe aza mai zaroor aaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Har ek gham se bacho hussain hussain karo</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Bichaao farshe aza mai zaroor aaungi x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Tumhare ashko ko mai saath leke jaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">Bichaao farshe aza mai zaroor aaungi x 2</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">1. Wo jin gharo me azakhanae hussain saja<br />
To un gharo me rahega sada qayaam mera<br />
Ye mera wada<br />
Ye mera wada hai har haal me nibhaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">2. Shabihe jhulae asgar sajayenge jo bhi<br />
To unki godiya khaali nahi rahengi kabhi<br />
Mai unko sadqae besheer de ke jaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">3. Alam bayade alamdar jo uthaayenge<br />
Diler aur wafadar honge wo bacche<br />
Mai unke dilse har ek khauf ko mitaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">4. Haa wo yateema jo tarikiyo me thi har dam<br />
Charaag yaad me uski jala ke rakhna tum<br />
Mai us yateemae shabbir ko bhi laaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">5. Thi ek bahan jise armaan reh gaya tha kabhi<br />
Jo ho sake to saja lena ek sehra bhi<br />
Mai ashke fatema sughra na bhool paaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">6. Mere hussain ka tabooto taziya rakhkar<br />
Karoge giryao matam rahoge nauhagar<br />
Mai apne ashko se taboot wo sajaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">7. Bataya jafare sadiq ne waise hi rona<br />
Chupa ke aasu na shabbir pe buka karna<br />
Karungi mai bhi buka ashke gham bahaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">8. Jo haq hai purse ka is tarah se ada karna<br />
Salamo soz padho aur marsiya padhna<br />
Mai iska ajr tumhe hashr me dilaaungi</p>

<p dir=""ltr"">9. Payam meesumo salman pohche ye sab tak<br />
Bahisht me na chale jaaye matami jab tak<br />
Qasam hussain ki x 2<br />
Qasam hussain ki mai khuld me na jaaungi</p>
</p>